<p>For the sake of keeping it simple, I suggest you use jQuery, it has two useful methods you can use <a href="http://api.jquery.com/jquery.ajax/" rel="nofollow"><code>$.ajax</code></a> and <a href="http://api.jquery.com/jquery.ajax/" rel="nofollow"><code>$.get</code></a></p>

<p>Your JavaScript could look something like this:</p>

